5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 1.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 482.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"643\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Expression of any three pDC markers&nbsp;(*) and absent expression of all expected negative markers</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
